{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03254",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 4.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Good afternoon, uh, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.17,
      "end_seconds": 10.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "So, yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.35,
      "end_seconds": 21.24,
      "duration_seconds": 8.89,
      "text": "I mean, you know, so the thing is, I've got a splash of cleaning fluid in my eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.33,
      "end_seconds": 25.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.48,
      "end_seconds": 31.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "It's been four weeks, I'm fairly sure. And blurred vision, too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.19,
      "end_seconds": 42.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.25,
      "end_seconds": 52.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.24,
      "end_seconds": 78.73,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "Okay: BP is 123 over 82, temp 36.6 degrees, SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 79.29,
      "end_seconds": 80.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.24,
      "end_seconds": 85.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "We'll look at it together shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.62,
      "end_seconds": 91.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "Could you come over to the couch, please?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.17,
      "end_seconds": 94.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.71,
      "end_seconds": 117.68,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "The eye is very red with a cloudy cornea and the pH of the tears is very high."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.65,
      "end_seconds": 124.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "All finished, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.16,
      "end_seconds": 146.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "A few quick ones: head injury or both eyes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.4,
      "end_seconds": 156.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "No head injury or both eyes, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.57,
      "end_seconds": 159.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Right, right. Your breathing, any trouble there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.12,
      "end_seconds": 162.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.32,
      "end_seconds": 165.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.87,
      "end_seconds": 169.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.13,
      "end_seconds": 172.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.29,
      "end_seconds": 178.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.47,
      "end_seconds": 181.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.35,
      "end_seconds": 186.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.31,
      "end_seconds": 190.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.57,
      "end_seconds": 194.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.66,
      "end_seconds": 200.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Alright, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.81,
      "end_seconds": 205.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "No, you know, I've always been fairly healthy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.27,
      "end_seconds": 208.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Any regular medication at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.21,
      "end_seconds": 216.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.81,
      "end_seconds": 229.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.09,
      "end_seconds": 232.13,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "No, never."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.82,
      "end_seconds": 250.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.51,
      "end_seconds": 253.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.37,
      "end_seconds": 262.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, it points towards an alkali chemical burn to the eye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.29,
      "end_seconds": 266.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.77,
      "end_seconds": 283.74,
      "duration_seconds": 15.97,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an alkali chemical burn to the eye, but I'd like to confirm. I want an urgent eye assessment done, that's for chemical eye injury."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 285.58,
      "end_seconds": 290.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "We have a slot Tuesday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.42,
      "end_seconds": 313.78,
      "duration_seconds": 22.36,
      "text": "I'll start you on sterile saline irrigation, 2 litres, continuous, until pH neutral. It's for chemical eye burn. I am washing the eye now, keep it open and do not stop. We'll catch up straight away. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.49,
      "end_seconds": 318.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.8,
      "end_seconds": 321.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}